9. **Assemble & write report** → `review/HW-003-review.md` with `## Summary`, `## Criteria Checklist`, `## Findings`, `## Test Output` in that order. Findings sorted Blocker→Major→Minor, then file-path alphabetical.
10. **Verify no source mutation** → AC-13 `git diff -- greet.ts greet.test.ts package.json`. No git ⇒ fallback integrity check (hash/mtime compare) + record finding.
11. **Exit code** → `0` if verdict PASS, `≥1` if FAIL (AC-12).

